{"type":"message","id":"1466e084","parentId":"ce932471","timestamp":"2026-03-11T01:44:30.110Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering response options**\n\nI think I need to make sure my response is welcoming and not repetitive. A good greeting sets the tone for the conversation! I'll brainstorm a few variations to keep it fresh and engaging, maybe mixing in different friendly phrases. It's important to come off as warm to help the user feel comfortable. I just have to be mindful not to overdo it, so it doesn’t sound too scripted or awkward. Let's see what I can come up with!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b0c8f508f8819f84d749353d1553e8\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpsMj5q8wSA3jujdhZ88ExQw9WD4tbnpOL3VdBnJ6tq7ulsw2QSKOoVQ2nExkFbzqgabXHEYFn65gCeZhkgxSGSYxVI4zkgWnFLhC6NFMgr1ba-yu_KhhLo7wZgQjTXoT55rhi13Vk4k_2jwcu32N-Mv8ZwUh-dugVoJK5YZf2cRoIeEnP0URAS5IJ44iEDeODOZY78MtO3PEcDcWj07Da9boP5P4mHplVLohuyc1iqUyzM7-UabllNK5mZLpSppYe2hlej9GOXpRAtcYSIzsmPlkeIgJG6ijIZiU11avkrAn_afm4SttoKXHv7QWeVazeFs3cUgir9iQ-BRlyHhF3AUMczsjRksudrabdTQ6ImAZRrIk7nAO3ragjC1JSF2nZsDw7ydukqKQJTkpOaKpOyTObi36_36b6-uWnYDom-RUPEazQChN7uvCitVTpF0Sdyrf-Dwnd9zu0NP3FvgMUS7lxQ6d_rcZ-qpdW6QBqo7Ox9SYxYIC3aTd2C6OT59ifvEAmVViYlXlkVz1YBGQ8-Lw8t_GM2ck4fevnxrk_-Q98wzqUP6kx0sSAW4C8-YusYYpBTdFbIUvZLkMs5PLJvaSuo6MT5_ihCb1i3zJts2OmB6GABWhUmWU5lQPz3a4Y8kGYZcVLb4P-epmga2o9245opyGvaIFcrY03rNtpo8Qz9IPt1U07YFuLFx7PZabon_JXv5aFdO-dT2Rmo4NqPU0--ydbL5X8tp-8ZeBL6OROazlgXDZ0gJKLbHLbcwfgxG-R5pI6UCz_P97TcpJeuANjMh6Gvc6i68YPAEqyUl78uRFsi0hPDVnkYAFAHXF1J0hGaEHUd1d7N0cZxY8-X6-KKu_y9yXUJ4IvTLIi3TSK-BAwGCoWUpDBCHjOCglZEgcq\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering response options**\\n\\nI think I need to make sure my response is welcoming and not repetitive. A good greeting sets the tone for the conversation! I'll brainstorm a few variations to keep it fresh and engaging, maybe mixing in different friendly phrases. It's important to come off as warm to help the user feel comfortable. I just have to be mindful not to overdo it, so it doesn’t sound too scripted or awkward. Let's see what I can come up with!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 你好，我在。\n\n先别太正式，咱们把身份定一下，不然后面总像刚开机。\n\n默认我先自称 **理财助手**，风格可以是：\n- **稳健派**：先看风险，再谈收益\n- **直给派**：不绕弯，直接说结论\n- **陪跑派**：帮你持续记、持续看、持续提醒\n\n你只要告诉我两件事就行：\n1. **我怎么称呼你？**\n2. **你希望我主要帮你什么？**  \n   比如：记账、基金/股票分析、资产配置、保险梳理、退休规划、消费决策\n\n如果你愿意，我也可以顺手把我们这套“默认工作方式”定下来，比如：\n- 你偏 **保守 / 平衡 / 激进**\n- 你看重 **稳稳增值 / 现金流 / 长期复利 / 灵活取用**\n- 你希望我回答时 **简短结论优先**，还是 **带推导过程**\n\n你回我一句：\n**“叫我X，先帮我做Y”**  \n我们就直接开工。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b0c8f92f08819fbf6293cc2c21fd3d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":15519,"output":283,"cacheRead":2560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18362,"cost":{"input":0.038797500000000006,"output":0.0042450000000000005,"cacheRead":0.0006399999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.043682500000000006}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773193458787}}
