{"type":"message","id":"45d8217f","parentId":"787790b0","timestamp":"2026-03-11T05:53:01.647Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Explaining access issues**\n\nI think there might be a problem with pairing code or the user. Maybe it's trying to access something from a different user ID. If the code has already been approved, there could be an issue with the process or gateway instance. I wonder if we should ask for the exact error message? Checking the sessions might be helpful, but perhaps running the openclaw status isn't necessary. I’ll keep it concise!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b103319ad8819fbf12c9d10b70a6d8\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpsQM1Y89G97tSitqLPwtengk6ea5qsCz1GBRY59abgPOSPuc6gG8gOXtyLyREw2Q_tfGqmHAEsDytUggEvFW3PY5lpO3JdFun0a0e57ioV4vlFXsFe473ISlSWfGB1781rrMwQVJu1zir8Yi7BZDfvf486Ms1uLzTDPBPvRTbk8XkT1FDxFNIjXPBbk3yKYDVAHkS_R6jKOMIqYbFisddT9cVW4G7rTr_P3DNAZn2CO9RLe2g1BcsgFQAomw8ybUfF_JtNBqPZ0qDooh_tADl0AZXxfjp2sGwt4zjzR36ZXVf4ktVitrXMBH4UWzgsrVy5P_Y5udjXRcR3Vf8-Ax1dY1PsHykpa4Zpj7SvqunKahWEKQgj6u64hfKPCSuf3ER6e4V1jaOOE_CPQclBmEj04y_DncLkyAY-Gne6iFfZstztofQ7gtycIT0S8PLFY4cRFLRs7KQITTXLpT319Dh05VQDeIg8wNUCF-mNJXijqLzBqCpGf1yu9qfObCAzLlIFCdy4uv08TCZVH5YShOIQa01xvizAlfY5LR8Xm2EmrOeN-7x5kIuimSC5LMFGDsrfl7vo3HuouN-flsENTJWJDf_bTPlSnOwXAVkgQFSpWIqVy5QGkH1nIeyK23Dq2UY_5MrYhNkehnw6LrF5j7QruDY8UdJ9ktYg1bKRQQAJC4ryOwDfVjcajCff9eQ-nxCD1rSYvBwyc0AA3GzPiO9MP_JKkoMSoF1bSQvQFS-hGbcZTgdKoOaHMJfZteYm9eiZr717GuJwZcIxOEHOdpqAPBNohadICIv7MgyRF1-X3dpYhPms-vmPA3Sb7v4tQ1WupxWJOO4i6ks_B7HI5P5cjHwfbo_uIZzGghvntiQ6Ii8VFpXgG9G5vJ9fFN_mAAZg285VnMYCKQS68dwhZOPSWtwB-iKzZiIMVaG0_h3mVDMY81KvgvITPCWBjUhEaNkEv99y9ztBgKv8zt-mT0VavM31Y-09wlO92OXYqjIg6I1iVkThHWCmVETGnVKIjYT4DehPExOoTt0dMTI7HYioibXuutMzeWipRx07SBZQswSptQYpDkMRMmywGqTUhVhrsuPUnkZt6soQy6yl8Iz4o8Lfu8tvi4MFESVEpXhKu0jvgM2V_igGeaOvnD6uEBH2AQ5tu2dI2wpnxSl49tVyNqbChPkJA2aowHf5rg3nYNWWTrBE91lKwoD4zxTvKsQaqis14j-mT6B09HLIUp65F4uOFtJp-f7AHDCfazlsZM8_aY=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Explaining access issues**\\n\\nI think there might be a problem with pairing code or the user. Maybe it's trying to access something from a different user ID. If the code has already been approved, there could be an issue with the process or gateway instance. I wonder if we should ask for the exact error message? Checking the sessions might be helpful, but perhaps running the openclaw status isn't necessary. I’ll keep it concise!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 最常见原因就两个：\n\n1. **你批准的不是这次提示里的那组配对码**\n   - 配对码是一次性的、按当前请求生成的。\n   - 你之前批的是 `PV33HGAC`\n   - 现在你说执行的是 `TBGKR8YJ`\n   - 如果飞书里报错对应的是另一条提示，那就会看起来像“明明批了还是不行”。\n\n2. **你批配对的 OpenClaw 实例，不是正在收飞书消息的那个实例**\n   - 比如本机有多个 OpenClaw 进程 / 不同终端环境 / 不同网关实例\n   - 你在 A 实例上 approve，但飞书消息其实进了 B 实例\n\n另外还有一个细节：\n- 飞书里提示的不只是配对码，还有 **Feishu user id**\n- 必须确认提示里的 **user id** 和你要授权的对象一致\n\n你可以这样快速排查：\n\n### 先看飞书里“最新一次报错”给出的完整信息\n确认三样东西：\n- `Feishu user id`\n- `Pairing code`\n- 报错时间\n\n### 然后在**同一台运行网关的机器**上执行\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway status\n```\n\n再用**飞书最新提示里的那一个 code**执行：\n```bash\nopenclaw pairing approve feishu <最新的配对码>\n```\n\n如果你本机 `openclaw` 不在 PATH，改用你之前能成功的完整路径。\n\n### 如果还是不行\n把这两样发我：\n1. 飞书里最新那条 **access not configured** 的完整提示\n2. 你执行 approve 后终端的完整输出\n\n我可以直接帮你判断是：\n- 批错码了\n- 批错实例了\n- 还是网关没正常接管飞书消息\n\n如果你愿意，我下一条可以直接给你一份**最短排查清单**，你照着 3 步就能定位。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b103355b64819fb13c4a76f959fcbc\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":177,"output":529,"cacheRead":27648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28354,"cost":{"input":0.0004425,"output":0.007935,"cacheRead":0.006912,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0152895}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773208366166}}
