ly the plugin logs. It seems like using exec with the OpenClaw path could help with the status and logs. I wonder if inspecting sessions might be easier, though I have to think about the CLI issue. I'll consider running the OpenClaw status along with the gateway status to gather the necessary information. Let's see how that goes!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我先按排障流程查根因：确认是不是批到错实例、网关状态异常，或者 Feishu 配对没有真正落到当前进程。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b103d08f84819f88c0637fdd58cdec\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_iDJ4Gi9JwoqX3aCVcFun7eFJ|fc_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b103d208c0819f9e828dc5c033fb12","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"/Users/zcg/.nvm/versions/node/v23.11.1/bin/openclaw gateway status","workdir":"/Users/zcg/.openclaw/agents/investment-advisor","yieldMs":1000,"timeout":30},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"/Users/zcg/.nvm/versions/node/v23.11.1/bin/openclaw gateway status\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/zcg/.openclaw/agents/investment-advisor\",\"yieldMs\":1000,\"timeout\":30}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8z1CfKbRK5aZn06606xC1Aow|fc_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b103d208d0819fbe85c7bc4d7ee601","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ps aux | grep -i '[o]penclaw'","workdir":"/Users/zcg/.openclaw/agents/investment-advisor","yieldMs":1000,"timeout":30},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"ps aux | grep -i '[o]penclaw'\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/zcg/.openclaw/agents/investment-advisor\",\"yieldMs\":1000,\"timeout\":30}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2401,"output":235,"cacheRead":28288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30924,"cost":{"input":0.006002500000000001,"output":0.003525,"cacheRead":0.007071999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0165995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773208524466}}
