行交易。保持数据驱动和风险优先的原则。\"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"default\": {\n          \"dmPolicy\": \"open\",\n          \"groupPolicy\": \"open\",\n          \"allowFrom\": [\n            \"*\"\n          ],\n          \"enabled\": true\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"gateway\": {\n    \"port\": 18789,\n    \"mode\": \"local\",\n    \"bind\": \"loopback\",\n    \"auth\": {\n      \"mode\": \"token\",\n      \"token\": \"0bc8e7e5ffbb957cc46d25b66ef21d26e8ef77ec20beb734\"\n    },\n    \"tailscale\": {\n      \"mode\": \"off\",\n      \"resetOnExit\": false\n    },\n    \"nodes\": {\n      \"denyCommands\": [\n        \"camera.snap\",\n        \"camera.clip\",\n        \"screen.record\",\n        \"calendar.add\",\n        \"contacts.add\",\n        \"reminders.add\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"plugins\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"feishu\"\n    ],\n    \"load\": {\n      \"paths\": []\n    },\n    \"entries\": {\n      \"feishu\": {\n        \"enabled\": true\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773208582842}}
{"type":"message","id":"52408451","parentId":"44f73fa1","timestamp":"2026-03-11T05:56:43.100Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Diagnosing account issues**\n\nI noticed the Aha account investment settings are allowing messages without needing pairing, but the logs indicate a pairing request for dingding-dev. This means messages are mistakenly connecting to the dingding-dev account rather than the investment account. The user mentioned Feishu DM from an account that actually points to dingding-dev in the gateway logs. There might be a configuration mix-up between bot accounts or possibly the user is messaging the wrong bot. I need to check the failed delivery queue for more details before responding.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b104094a54819f9f233522c27c6ec0\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpsQQOmiKui-gfiP3R_-45jgNkG58hlMDUlUJr-yd1SHfS2zwdAvK198RPAStMgAmM2IHh_Ox2uadE5ETjI46v9hLB9JfmSamEzqLPbom7zoQKc7H8L3iT0a_NBmczy72AkXwAJM15gb3BHvASj7WH51vEH1qVdYYeBmy7fgiGubptWWr5aytMhyehOiOjepnSKTqPn8Lz7i3RhFdqRg8t0AbNiiEh61kPFB2oeUxk2tH8AqBYzIv1KzTql2RoD96iw57ZHlgfMvGAbjwTpu3wsBX2EKOHicBhl_vGGN-Lh6-XTWOtIZtl5JPsgRtRsG5-J3hgo_NH4woaKn1TwfKicEHkvfgZ7asj3BN3KudIsp8ZOqAZ-TtX9EnfftjDo8Hslwp5xIXPe3BBqQnlxv6b9yKnILh3weD1ojdbzhev38oQs6AOQknVYLUdO2mURJc8rQUNasxSJx1eo4iAIlTiQI1kqfuS22mkCwWtDyN6_4R_aOn-tjpFfIE_Qh0s-6nC7DDGZTow6Zc5gh4nPVtzIz8bmG5l0-rSlAVKbzQW_X1I6D-6ncHlDHCzjxXvIO9q9n9i9n1e6WQ2vqDdEVUPGKUpHvEDdxhUK73gswC5Wti_-CEl79ITUq8iDJrQkv6psn3sPK8qobM_Bmjh7a-OSP9Wgp5-P-GUQWSqb44h_ekEXGnZ8QoNxbiJFNT-VMlrKCE1Biss5R1QTsWdeLfKlRXfbcjVEEIXca8kUbHg9tXv6Afp1q1zVNbyA3F8dhtPHuFO7ca0XCtD6pPOcYWIu7fOSu6EhiTIGeEwxLvvsIVeZ0HAprvYnjMQNEksYpr2JaWjiiVUioYeawtVWkRYIaDHOm_OIjZh3gy7I7MAZJELwnEHpk-tPrgc3FJXEJNhqC918h5HJJtKeLg9bKonJZJs8itNPx48WbZ6brmRyf3PT9X86VcCwGeNdBL6P7ZwuvntloqKnGHt6sjsixL0FuzfY_rltlXDhQ-cOKrX6yVLCba3mg7VzN7Sdg_Zlhtm4TcUWRRL5zfPnSx5zDrkrjbKgS3GCZ2Wh86AC70wjbHiTQKkdxsM3jenaQBujGc_Ten3bvveh1mN0J7YSFFWFQgIxXHOZHNFRa31oXfk_sF5yd_npJz61TvTo0I24rsAJgljKiR7HJf0L5bLczvpsQjOpUkSRlAlkkOSIQE_Qd0dX1bscyCqavhuYg4-44U5_u-3HMUW-Zu3poJQGpMQX9C3jSCG8SeUZaP6v3qSvgTuLcuHk4uwuPd0Z12g6sN0Wz7vncgq9CnSMl374hoPKtvAmEe4Wzk_y6b4g-x7DXFJ1CG5YavJF5SwMHCAdQJGEHcMmuad2VW7AlPZgqDQg4RlEsmmlaDEW1vuSVSBKAupTg9H8C4AEU39WDZrTmT3NH4XXI_NuJN6JkRhPUqtJcJ84BXJfBZI3yqzTdJUXHQyMbDwjNhQHmn_Ub0cZcWN7WtmvEZUcfEVTKEmXTJoN8qK1HFb6q6NmrIejXhtuAeXDua1sjKURHJYP9k7NsnWmn0pYsW0wKB8wfzoNxd5ICUAmhbxB5HkXlRz_BMssFOaQxqKWbZhtXgSDQ0eR7EtlF_NMYShFgINim_McW_hibEayw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Diagnosing account issues**\\n\\nI noticed the Aha account investment settings are allowing messages without needing pairing, but the logs indicate a pairing request for dingding-dev. This means messages are mistakenly connecting to the dingding-dev account rather than the investment account. The user mentioned Feishu DM from an account that actually points to dingding-dev in the gateway logs. There might be a configuration mix-up between bot accounts or possibly the user is messaging the wrong bot. I need to check the failed delivery queue for more details before responding.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 我查到根因了，不是你配对码用错。\n\n**结论：你在飞书里发消息时，网关实际把这条消息识别到了另一个 Feishu 账号 `dingding-dev`，不是 `investment`。**\n\n我看到的证据是：\n\n- 你的配置里，**`investment` 这个账号本来就是开放私聊**：\n  - `channels.feishu.accounts.investment.dmPolicy = open`\n  - `channels.feishu.accounts.investment.allowFrom = [\"*\"]`\n- 按这个配置，**正常不应该触发 pairing**\n- 但网关日志里实际记录的是：\n  - `feishu[dingding-dev]: received message from ou_992dc10...`\n  - 然后马上：\n  - `feishu[dingding-dev]: pairing request sender=ou_992dc10...`\n\n也就是说：\n\n### 根因\n**你以为在给 `investment` 这个机器人发消息，但网关实际把消息路由到了 `dingding-dev` 这个 Feishu account。**  \n而 `dingding-dev` 这边不是开放直通，所以它一直把你当成“要配对的新用户”，于是你每次都会收到授权提示。\n\n---\n\n### 这也解释了为什么你“反复 approve 也没用”\n因为你批的是同一个用户 ID，批准动作本身是成功写进去了，我也看到了：\n\n- `Approved feishu sender ou_992dc10ef5a216445337f63c0a638b03`\n\n但**真正处理你消息的那个通道/账号仍然继续走 pairing 流程**，说明问题不在 pairing code，而在**消息进错账号**或者**账号映射混乱**。\n\n---\n\n## 你现在该怎么处理\n\n### 最可能的两个方向\n\n#### 方案 A：确认你在飞书里聊天的到底是哪一个机器人\n请检查飞书里你对话的机器人 App 名称 / 头像 / 应用信息。\n\n当前本机配置里有两个 Feishu 账号：\n- `dingding-dev` → **盯钉喵开发运营助理**\n- `investment` → **我的理财助手**\n\n你应该发给的是：\n**“我的理财助手”**\n\n如果你实际上点进的是：\n**“盯钉喵开发运营助理”**\n那就会一直触发配对。\n\n---\n\n#### 方案 B：OpenClaw 的 Feishu 入站识别把消息错误归到了 `dingding-dev`\n如果你确认自己聊的就是“我的理财助手”，那就说明是**Feishu 多账号接入配置/映射出了问题**。\n\n这种情况下，pairing 本身不是修复点，修的是：\n- Feishu account 路由\n- bot appId / appSecret 对应关系\n- webhook/event 接收落到哪个 accountId\n\n---\n\n## 我已经确认的事实\n1. **网关运行正常**\n2. **approve 命令执行成功**\n3. **investment 账号配置本身允许开放 DM**\n4. **日志显示实际入站却落在 `dingding-dev`**\n\n所以现在最值得做的不是继续 approve，而是**检查 Feishu 机器人身份和账号映射**。\n\n---\n\n## 最短排查动作\n你先只做 1 件事：\n\n**在飞书里打开这个聊天窗口的机器人资料页，看看它显示的机器人名字到底是：**\n- **我的理财助手**\n还是\n- **盯钉喵开发运营助理**\n\n把结果告诉我。\n\n如果你愿意，我下一步可以直接继续帮你做：\n**检查本机 Feishu 多账号配置是否串号，并给出该怎么改。**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b1040e2d64819f8ea22b6813859ed9\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1612,"output":941,"cacheRead":88192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":90745,"cost":{"input":0.004030000000000001,"output":0.014115,"cacheRead":0.022047999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.040193}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773208582845}}
