{"type":"message","id":"2d32eefe","parentId":"dd31c26c","timestamp":"2026-03-11T05:57:48.224Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying root cause**\n\nI need to explain the root cause and recommend using the correct bot. I think it might also be good to mention that any errors on dingding are expected, and we shouldn't require more tools for this situation. It's important to communicate this clearly to the user, so they understand the context and can proceed appropriately. Keeping things straightforward should help avoid any confusion.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b10450e8b4819fb9c8c0a7312bae63\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpsQRTr_VsTKxq6hK7HZSC_TC56HcNu1lZktZHMVHVv7Lr3sNFHNgya3nZkoG5Qae5hnqS-FptnxoaclyIU_bzt3scLrlPUwtVubYlteCfJM1g_GuV9_uKmt8EH3wyHxYhNm20jNPe0cN3_S7rGom3Fb9g500bMKRL99FuRGbZrHCKdR8bpVATvqthICC8ZUN4OMSTGCZEUgIStYaICNv21wqJA4oQalhsgcFYiVB6KbmhbZ9Y2WgtX2U-E80hG9TXdMAx3_3S8v0qFb-0OXkILw2FCqfxQrfRLrigeV_vXNpP63Ue_uPggxmm_cYQhiEHgtGkq7-wPcEoQmJxZJ1N8keAwqr0QQVZETaNazdSwj0Sk3Ps3PMlzRvlN93qYOBOor9pCaTqqRgHRuPQmryaXMVeRTVFNKYUFMmIDmZji4YpSvWj6-uk42ClhetwHOFjYj2Ururpww-Y26r01EaNrgfKRVAXIM86LmKeKEhw3bnFXdEk3rnE6xDms8uxbVTN9Kj7uSJDenrKyErU46ihphQpuj1iFH_DofM30J4VirvW4ovTgMoaZ5E_bLrChjbC5F3LbpcWw9N4UijAqsjytDk_wCJoXJ-IlOVj28hnMX9Hq3VWOfdGWmLZRY17oJOQnTEYuDx_3LFH4WQgkUyu-4dWroDDUVZRZcsyW-SE9D26KIOcSkGiiuplQTOq9Q8EGx__I_-lFnDVIz1F6fdYMwyoZgNIGa8Lhwh-5bJVlu79oducj-ciE3b5FIWSxlJKrMnIcedNBzR87BE1fLIR-JX7ekZUBwOEtSAD8eRwk7r9qrERdHPUJSBls36UgI-NJ3knAK5OANzTTzpXDj4vmExeHvKlxomb3nO7rY_AheQFmkBYaE1KI6VW64SGXoahsoVZjEM7RKxDfv0-oabebBPT1W4GDPt8pPntX5VjabmObXByBHz46ExmRsJtZCcuqsX1NE3I2UYxQd610DxF7KauJ-G-pZ3-UHPMhdCcDm3DHhY=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying root cause**\\n\\nI need to explain the root cause and recommend using the correct bot. I think it might also be good to mention that any errors on dingding are expected, and we shouldn't require more tools for this situation. It's important to communicate this clearly to the user, so they understand the context and can proceed appropriately. Keeping things straightforward should help avoid any confusion.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 那就对上了。\n\n**结论：**\n- **“我的理财助手”** 这条链路是正常的，能收能回，说明 `investment` 账号配置没问题。\n- **“盯钉喵开发运营助理”** 报错，是另一套 Feishu 账号 / 另一只机器人在触发配对流程。\n\n也就是说，问题不是 OpenClaw 整体坏了，而是：\n\n### 真实情况\n- `investment` → 正常\n- `dingding-dev` → 对你这个飞书用户仍在走 pairing / 权限校验\n\n---\n\n## 这意味着什么\n如果你的目标只是用 **“我的理财助手”**，那现在其实**已经可以正常用了**，不用继续折腾 pairing。\n\n如果你还想让 **“盯钉喵开发运营助理”** 也能正常跟你聊，那就得单独修它。\n\n---\n\n## 为什么会这样\n因为这是**两个独立的 Feishu account 配置**：\n\n- **我的理财助手**  \n  对应 `investment`\n- **盯钉喵开发运营助理**  \n  对应 `dingding-dev`\n\n我之前查到：\n- 你的消息在报错时，实际进的是 `dingding-dev`\n- 而 `investment` 这边本来就是开放私聊，所以没问题\n\n所以你看到的现象完全合理：\n- 一个机器人正常\n- 另一个机器人继续提示授权\n\n---\n\n## 你现在可以怎么做\n\n### 如果你只关心理财助手\n直接忽略“盯钉喵开发运营助理”的报错，继续用 **我的理财助手** 就行。\n\n### 如果你想把“盯钉喵开发运营助理”也修好\n我建议下一步查这几个点：\n\n1. `dingding-dev` 的 `dmPolicy` / `allowFrom`\n2. 它是不是也该设成开放私聊\n3. 它的事件路由和 app 配置是否正确\n4. 是否存在插件层对 `dingding-dev` 的额外配对逻辑\n\n---\n\n## 最简判断\n**你当前的理财机器人已经正常。**  \n报错的是另一只开发运营机器人，不影响你现在用 **我的理财助手**。\n\n如果你愿意，我下一步可以直接帮你：\n**检查并修复 `dingding-dev` 为什么还在强制 pairing。**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b94add67f4bb7d90169b104536888819fb06c2cc1d661f054\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":62451,"output":576,"cacheRead":28160,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91187,"cost":{"input":0.1561275,"output":0.00864,"cacheRead":0.007039999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.1718075}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773208652333}}
